  "html": "<div class=\"screen-runtime\"><div class=\"prototype-screen\"><div class=\"screen-slot screen-slot--header\" data-slot=\"header\"><header class=\"topbar\"><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" alt=\"\"><span>AdvogadoJá</span></header></div><div class=\"screen-layout\"><div class=\"screen-slot screen-slot--main\" data-slot=\"main\"><div class=\"registration__shell\"><div class=\"registration__intro\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Dados pessoais</p><h1>Contato</h1><p>Informações privadas usadas para identificação e comunicação da conta.</p></div><div class=\"progress\" aria-label=\"Etapa 3 de 7\"><span></span></div><form class=\"form-card\" data-registration-form=\"\"><div class=\"field\"><input id=\"reg-email\" name=\"email\" type=\"email\" placeholder=\" \" autocomplete=\"email\" data-reg-field=\"email\" required><label for=\"reg-email\">E-mail</label></div><div class=\"field\"><input id=\"reg-phone\" name=\"phoneE164\" type=\"tel\" placeholder=\" \" autocomplete=\"tel\" data-reg-field=\"phoneE164\" required><label for=\"reg-phone\">Telefone com DDI</label></div><div class=\"form-note\"><strong>Privacidade</strong><span>Telefone e e-mail não são exibidos publicamente por padrão.</span></div><div class=\"form-actions\"><button class=\"secondary-action\" type=\"button\" data-action=\"navegar.auth.cadastro.identificacao\">Voltar</button><button class=\"button\" type=\"submit\" data-action=\"navegar.auth.cadastro.endereco\">Continuar</button></div><p class=\"form-status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p></form></div></div></div></div></div>",
